The files in programs/icon/jcon-compiler/ are the JCON translator and linker,
a compiler for the Icon programming language written in Icon, originally from:

  JCON — a Java implementation of Icon
  Gregg Townsend and Todd Proebsting
  Copyright 1998-1999 Arizona Board of Regents; all rights reserved.
  http://www.cs.arizona.edu/icon/jcon/

JCON's license permits use, copying, modification, and distribution provided
the full notice travels with the copies; that notice is reproduced verbatim in
programs/icon/jcon-compiler/COPYRIGHT. The only modification made here is the
addition of statement-terminating semicolons required by the SCRIP Icon
front-end (see that directory's README.md). These files are included for
reference, testing, and educational purposes. The CC0 dedication in LICENSE
applies to original contributions in this repository; it does not retroactively
affect the copyright status of the original JCON sources.
